{
  "title": "Xiuyi's Challenges",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Xiuyi&#39;s Challenges</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Side Quests\">Side</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"startLocation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Starting Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jinzhou\" title=\"Jinzhou\">Jinzhou</a>,&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/Huanglong\" title=\"Huanglong\">Huanglong</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Xiuyi\" title=\"Xiuyi\">Xiuyi</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Talk to Xiuyi near the Souvenir Store</li>\n<li>Step onto the platform made of wooden boxes\n<ol><li>Complete the challenge</li></ol></li>\n<li>Start a new session of footwork practice.</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Hidden Challenge near the Souvenir Store, comes up as \"Inquire about Xiuyi's challenge\"</li>\n<li>You get six chests for completing the multiple challenges.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Inquire about Xiuyi's challenge)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> What are you doing?</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> You look like you're interested in our training. I'm training a footwork unique to Liondance--the backflip!</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Oh, I forgot to introduce myself. I am Xiuyi, a Liondancer at Liondance Troupe! I'm a peer of Lingyang.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Footwork unique to Liondance?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> The backflip?</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Liondance is a dance style derived from martial arts. The postures and footworks often take root in traditional Huanglong martial arts, in which the backflip is an essential move.</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Most of the time we practice it on Plum Blossom Poles at Central Plains. While I was in Jinzhou and the space was limited, I set up a temporary platform for the practice. It attracted a great audience to my surprise.</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> It has gradually become a major street recreation here, so I decided to open it to the public. Everyone can try to do the backflip, and I hope this boots the popularity of Liondance.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> How should I do the backflip?</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Imagine the platform before you is a Plum Blossom Pole, and underneath it is a rushing, freezing stream.</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Another lion confronts you, attempting to take your territory. Now, you have to drive it away, yet the space doesn't allow you to perform martial arts, so you have to depend on the footwork. After all, you don't want to soak your shoes.</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> What you do is you leap high and Dash without a direction while you're airborne to perform an excellent backflip, which will not only blow away your opponent, but land you steadily on the Pole in one fell swoop.</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> To win my challenge, you have to successfully perform a number of backflips in a limited time. No \"soaking\", no help from any other items.</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> You wanna give it a try?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Arrow\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Arrow.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Arrow.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/41/Icon_Dialogue_Arrow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529052033\" /></span></span> Newbie in town. Easy level.\n<dl><dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Perfect for beginners. Great introductory practice for every Liondancer. Get some warm-up and we'll start right away.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Arrow\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Arrow.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Arrow.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/41/Icon_Dialogue_Arrow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529052033\" /></span></span> Getting warmer. Medium level.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Arrow\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Arrow.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Arrow.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/41/Icon_Dialogue_Arrow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529052033\" /></span></span> Hall of fame. Difficult level.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Exit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Exit.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Exit.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/66/Icon_Dialogue_Exit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240526052042\" /></span></span> Challenge again if you ever find the time.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> What level would you like to challenge this time, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Arrow\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Arrow.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Arrow.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/41/Icon_Dialogue_Arrow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529052033\" /></span></span> Newbie in town. Easy level.\n<dl><dt>(After completing Challenge)</dt>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Challenge concluded. Lion \"triumphed\".</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Your performance was a great showcase of skills, from which Liondancers including me can learn a lot.</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> I've prepared you something as a reward.</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Arrow\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Arrow.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Arrow.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/41/Icon_Dialogue_Arrow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529052033\" /></span></span> Getting warmer. Medium level.\n<dl><dt>(After completing Challenge)</dt>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Challenge concluded! Continuous success!</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Oh, can't afford to underestimate our Rover!</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Please accept your rewards!</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Arrow\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Arrow.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Arrow.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/41/Icon_Dialogue_Arrow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529052033\" /></span></span> Hall of famer. Difficult level.\n<dl><dt>(After completing Challenge)</dt>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Challenge concluded. Flawless performance!</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Impressive skills and footwork... I'm overwhelmed by your talent!</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Mr. Wufang always says: Observe others and correct yourself. I learned a lot from your footworks.</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> If you're interested in joining the Liondance Troupe, <a href=\"/wiki/Lingyang\" title=\"Lingyang\">Lingyang</a> and I would love to give you a referral.</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> A reward for you  to commemorate your success!</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Exit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Exit.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Exit.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/66/Icon_Dialogue_Exit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240526052042\" /></span></span> Challenge again if you ever find the time.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Fall on the ground)</dt>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Challenge concluded. Lion \"soaked\".</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Only a minor slip. Do you want to challenge again?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> One more time!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Option\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Option.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Option.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/9/9a/Icon_Dialogue_Option.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051958\" /></span></span> Is there any... tricks or something?\n<dl><dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> A successful backflip depends on the right jumping position and timing.</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> <span class=\"text-help\"><b>Jump forward,</b></span> not vertically, to reserve enough backspace.</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> If you feel the space is limited, you might as well <span class=\"text-help\"><b>use the diagonal</b></span> to get a longer backspace.</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> If you feel not skilled enough, you can practice more before the official challenge.</dd>\n<dd><b>Xiuyi:</b> Only a minor slip. Do you want to challenge again?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Return\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Return.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Return.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/51/Icon_Dialogue_Return.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240526052020\" /></span></span></dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Exit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Exit.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Exit.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/66/Icon_Dialogue_Exit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240526052042\" /></span></span> Take a short break.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><spa